{"page":194,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:41","surah":9,"ayah":41,"ar_uthmani":"ٱنفِرُوا۟ خِفَافًا وَثِقَالًا وَجَـٰهِدُوا۟ بِأَمْوَٰلِكُمْ وَأَنفُسِكُمْ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ ذَٰلِكُمْ خَيْرٌ لَّكُمْ إِن كُنتُمْ تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So go out, no matter whether you are lightly or heavily armed, and struggle in God’s way with your possessions and your persons: this is better for you, if you only knew.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱنفِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"Go forth","transliteration":"infirū","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خِفَافًۭا","en_gloss":"light","transliteration":"khifāfan","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَثِقَالًۭا","en_gloss":"or heavy","transliteration":"wathiqālan","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَجَـٰهِدُوا۟","en_gloss":"and strive","transliteration":"wajāhidū","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِأَمْوَٰلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"with your wealth","transliteration":"bi-amwālikum","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَنفُسِكُمْ","en_gloss":"and your lives","transliteration":"wa-anfusikum","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":8,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ذَٰلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālikum","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":11,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":15,"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","verse_key":"9:41"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٤١","en_gloss":"(41)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:41"}]},{"verse_key":"9:42","surah":9,"ayah":42,"ar_uthmani":"لَوْ كَانَ عَرَضًا قَرِيبًا وَسَفَرًا قَاصِدًا لَّٱتَّبَعُوكَ وَلَـٰكِنۢ بَعُدَتْ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلشُّقَّةُ ۚ وَسَيَحْلِفُونَ بِٱللَّهِ لَوِ ٱسْتَطَعْنَا لَخَرَجْنَا مَعَكُمْ يُهْلِكُونَ أَنفُسَهُمْ وَٱللَّهُ يَعْلَمُ إِنَّهُمْ لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They would certainly have followed you [Prophet] if the benefit was within sight and the journey short, but the distance seemed too great for them. They will swear by God, ‘If we could, we certainly would go out [to battle] with you,’ but they ruin themselves, for God knows that they are lying.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"it had been","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَرَضًۭا","en_gloss":"a gain","transliteration":"ʿaraḍan","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَرِيبًۭا","en_gloss":"near","transliteration":"qarīban","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَسَفَرًۭا","en_gloss":"and a journey","transliteration":"wasafaran","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَاصِدًۭا","en_gloss":"easy","transliteration":"qāṣidan","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَّٱتَّبَعُوكَ","en_gloss":"surely they (would) have followed you","transliteration":"la-ittabaʿūka","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنۢ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَعُدَتْ","en_gloss":"was long","transliteration":"baʿudat","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلشُّقَّةُ ۚ","en_gloss":"the distance","transliteration":"l-shuqatu","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَسَيَحْلِفُونَ","en_gloss":"And they will swear","transliteration":"wasayaḥlifūna","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"by Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَوِ","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"lawi","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱسْتَطَعْنَا","en_gloss":"we were able","transliteration":"is'taṭaʿnā","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَخَرَجْنَا","en_gloss":"certainly we (would) have come forth","transliteration":"lakharajnā","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مَعَكُمْ","en_gloss":"with you","transliteration":"maʿakum","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يُهْلِكُونَ","en_gloss":"They destroy","transliteration":"yuh'likūna","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أَنفُسَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their own selves","transliteration":"anfusahum","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"and Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":21,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":22,"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"(that) indeed, they","transliteration":"innahum","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":23,"ar":"لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) surely liars","transliteration":"lakādhibūna","verse_key":"9:42"},{"pos":24,"ar":"٤٢","en_gloss":"(42)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:42"}]},{"verse_key":"9:43","surah":9,"ayah":43,"ar_uthmani":"عَفَا ٱللَّهُ عَنكَ لِمَ أَذِنتَ لَهُمْ حَتَّىٰ يَتَبَيَّنَ لَكَ ٱلَّذِينَ صَدَقُوا۟ وَتَعْلَمَ ٱلْكَـٰذِبِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God forgive you [Prophet]! Why did you give them permission to stay at home before it had become clear to you which of them spoke the truth and which were liars?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"عَفَا","en_gloss":"(May) Allah forgive","transliteration":"ʿafā","verse_key":"9:43"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(May) Allah forgive","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:43"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَنكَ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"ʿanka","verse_key":"9:43"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِمَ","en_gloss":"Why (did)","transliteration":"lima","verse_key":"9:43"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَذِنتَ","en_gloss":"you grant leave","transliteration":"adhinta","verse_key":"9:43"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:43"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"9:43"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَتَبَيَّنَ","en_gloss":"(became) evident","transliteration":"yatabayyana","verse_key":"9:43"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"laka","verse_key":"9:43"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:43"},{"pos":11,"ar":"صَدَقُوا۟","en_gloss":"were truthful","transliteration":"ṣadaqū","verse_key":"9:43"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَتَعْلَمَ","en_gloss":"and you knew","transliteration":"wataʿlama","verse_key":"9:43"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰذِبِينَ","en_gloss":"the liars","transliteration":"l-kādhibīna","verse_key":"9:43"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٤٣","en_gloss":"(43)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:43"}]},{"verse_key":"9:44","surah":9,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"لَا يَسْتَـْٔذِنُكَ ٱلَّذِينَ يُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱللَّهِ وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ أَن يُجَـٰهِدُوا۟ بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ وَأَنفُسِهِمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَلِيمٌۢ بِٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who have faith in God and the Last Day do not ask you for exemption from struggle with their possessions and their persons- God knows exactly who is mindful of Him-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Would) not ask your permission","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَسْتَـْٔذِنُكَ","en_gloss":"(Would) not ask your permission","transliteration":"yastadhinuka","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ","en_gloss":"and the Day","transliteration":"wal-yawmi","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ","en_gloss":"the Last","transliteration":"l-ākhiri","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُجَـٰهِدُوا۟","en_gloss":"they strive","transliteration":"yujāhidū","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","en_gloss":"with their wealth","transliteration":"bi-amwālihim","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَأَنفُسِهِمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"and their lives","transliteration":"wa-anfusihim","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_gloss":"of the righteous","transliteration":"bil-mutaqīna","verse_key":"9:44"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٤٤","en_gloss":"(44)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:44"}]},{"verse_key":"9:45","surah":9,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا يَسْتَـْٔذِنُكَ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱللَّهِ وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ وَٱرْتَابَتْ قُلُوبُهُمْ فَهُمْ فِى رَيْبِهِمْ يَتَرَدَّدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"only those who do not have faith in God and the Last Day ask your permission to stay at home: they have doubt in their hearts and so they waver.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَسْتَـْٔذِنُكَ","en_gloss":"ask your leave","transliteration":"yastadhinuka","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ","en_gloss":"and the Day","transliteration":"wal-yawmi","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ","en_gloss":"the Last","transliteration":"l-ākhiri","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱرْتَابَتْ","en_gloss":"and (are in) doubts","transliteration":"wa-ir'tābat","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قُلُوبُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbuhum","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَهُمْ","en_gloss":"so they","transliteration":"fahum","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رَيْبِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their doubts","transliteration":"raybihim","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَتَرَدَّدُونَ","en_gloss":"they waver","transliteration":"yataraddadūna","verse_key":"9:45"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٤٥","en_gloss":"(45)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:45"}]},{"verse_key":"9:46","surah":9,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَلَوْ أَرَادُوا۟ ٱلْخُرُوجَ لَأَعَدُّوا۟ لَهُۥ عُدَّةً وَلَـٰكِن كَرِهَ ٱللَّهُ ٱنۢبِعَاثَهُمْ فَثَبَّطَهُمْ وَقِيلَ ٱقْعُدُوا۟ مَعَ ٱلْقَـٰعِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If they had really wanted to go out [to battle] with you, they would have made preparations, but God was loath to let them rise up and made them hold back. It was said, ‘Stay with those who stay behind.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرَادُوا۟","en_gloss":"they had wished","transliteration":"arādū","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْخُرُوجَ","en_gloss":"(to) go forth","transliteration":"l-khurūja","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَأَعَدُّوا۟","en_gloss":"surely they (would) have prepared","transliteration":"la-aʿaddū","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for it","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عُدَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"(some) preparation","transliteration":"ʿuddatan","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"But","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَرِهَ","en_gloss":"Allah disliked","transliteration":"kariha","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah disliked","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱنۢبِعَاثَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their being sent","transliteration":"inbiʿāthahum","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَثَبَّطَهُمْ","en_gloss":"so He made them lag behind","transliteration":"fathabbaṭahum","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَقِيلَ","en_gloss":"and it was said","transliteration":"waqīla","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱقْعُدُوا۟","en_gloss":"Sit","transliteration":"uq'ʿudū","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَعَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"maʿa","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْقَـٰعِدِينَ","en_gloss":"those who sit","transliteration":"l-qāʿidīna","verse_key":"9:46"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٤٦","en_gloss":"(46)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:46"}]},{"verse_key":"9:47","surah":9,"ayah":47,"ar_uthmani":"لَوْ خَرَجُوا۟ فِيكُم مَّا زَادُوكُمْ إِلَّا خَبَالًا وَلَأَوْضَعُوا۟ خِلَـٰلَكُمْ يَبْغُونَكُمُ ٱلْفِتْنَةَ وَفِيكُمْ سَمَّـٰعُونَ لَهُمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَلِيمٌۢ بِٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They would only have given you trouble if they had gone out [to battle] with you: they would have scurried around, trying to sow discord among you, and some of you would willingly have listened to them- God knows exactly who does evil.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَرَجُوا۟","en_gloss":"they (had) gone forth","transliteration":"kharajū","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِيكُم","en_gloss":"with you","transliteration":"fīkum","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":5,"ar":"زَادُوكُمْ","en_gloss":"they (would) have increased you","transliteration":"zādūkum","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":7,"ar":"خَبَالًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) confusion","transliteration":"khabālan","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَأَوْضَعُوا۟","en_gloss":"and would have been active","transliteration":"wala-awḍaʿū","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":9,"ar":"خِلَـٰلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"in your midst","transliteration":"khilālakum","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَبْغُونَكُمُ","en_gloss":"seeking (for) you","transliteration":"yabghūnakumu","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْفِتْنَةَ","en_gloss":"dissension","transliteration":"l-fit'nata","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَفِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"And among you (are some)","transliteration":"wafīkum","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":13,"ar":"سَمَّـٰعُونَ","en_gloss":"who would have listened","transliteration":"sammāʿūna","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَهُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بِٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"of the wrongdoers","transliteration":"bil-ẓālimīna","verse_key":"9:47"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٤٧","en_gloss":"(47)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:47"}]}]}